{
    "word": "drainpipe",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                "word": "drainpipe",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "166a8ebb-fd65-4818-b187-f74b81f37459",
                        "entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "drainpipes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "56547729-4ddb-3ac9-8311-5ba1e79b786a",
                        "entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pipe that carries fluid which is being drained.",
                            "A verticle pipe carrying water from the roof gutter down the side of a building; downspout."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f232bcda-49f3-4909-96ef-8f388428024f",
                                "sense_id": "56547729-4ddb-3ac9-8311-5ba1e79b786a",
                                "text": "He unlatched the window and stuck his head out — there was a drainpipe a couple of feet to the left but his room was on the second floor and it was too dark to tell whether the garden below was grass, soil, or paving."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d2470f6-e8f7-487b-8d8e-db0908e9d146",
                                "sense_id": "56547729-4ddb-3ac9-8311-5ba1e79b786a",
                                "text": "We said earlier that we normally use a curved or bent piece of pipe at the top of the drainpipe where it is connected to the gutter, and a fitting at the bottom end of the drainpipe that directs the water into a channel or a drain or gully."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f2e6a97-642f-4305-be4d-76e641e91698",
                                "sense_id": "56547729-4ddb-3ac9-8311-5ba1e79b786a",
                                "text": "There was a black drainpipe running the entire height of the hotel wall alongside her balcony and I managed to pull myself onto it, gripping the rough, rusty metal as firmly as I could."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84c384f5-6d18-3f7f-8272-b14472f5addd",
                        "entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pipe that carries fluid which is being drained.",
                            "A conduit for carrying rainwater or flood water."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b9f62c1-0518-4128-996d-4e1f85284940",
                                "sense_id": "84c384f5-6d18-3f7f-8272-b14472f5addd",
                                "text": "She's in a drainpipe--right there,\" I said, pointing toward the hole in the side of the ditch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cc23a7c-9c12-498d-8a71-1151954c38d7",
                                "sense_id": "84c384f5-6d18-3f7f-8272-b14472f5addd",
                                "text": "Where a lot owner knows that his premises will be flooded in case of a heavy rain, unless a certain city drainpipe in the street adjacent thereto is cleaned out, and gives no notice of it, and makes no effort to remedy the defect, he cannot recover of the city damages caused by flooding his premises during such storm."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a38a05c-1994-416a-acfb-1733894be8ed",
                                "sense_id": "84c384f5-6d18-3f7f-8272-b14472f5addd",
                                "text": "Her body was found stuffed in a big, ole drainpipe down near the river."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "981c53d1-3ecf-32cc-989e-9038ced8537d",
                        "entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pipe that carries fluid which is being drained.",
                            "A pipe that carries wastewater from a bathtub, shower, sink, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8c183e9-04ce-4215-b449-22e5e42c3a18",
                                "sense_id": "981c53d1-3ecf-32cc-989e-9038ced8537d",
                                "text": "First you should know that the size of the drain hole in the bottom of the sink is reflective of the drainpipe's diameter that has been standardized by the plumbing industry."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98f9279b-0f4f-4b29-b712-7ace865d1c5e",
                                "sense_id": "981c53d1-3ecf-32cc-989e-9038ced8537d",
                                "text": "A crude analogy is to liken this to water draining noisily from a bathtub. As the liquid falls down into the drainpipe, some of its swirling kinetic energy is converted into sound waves, water bashing against molecules of air."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c28d206-1aba-4239-8716-54a827360bf3",
                                "sense_id": "981c53d1-3ecf-32cc-989e-9038ced8537d",
                                "text": "Since we didn't have a septic tank, we made sure there was an empty bucket underneath the sink. That's where we had a straight drainpipe, and after the dishes were washed, we would take the bucket from underneath the sink and throw waatever was in there outside."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "648a96c2-b272-3fb1-8263-51fabd7433d9",
                        "entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pipe that carries fluid which is being drained.",
                            "A pipe that is part of a device or appliance for carrying away waste fluid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "712fb014-316f-497a-a7e3-d372fe895f9d",
                                "sense_id": "648a96c2-b272-3fb1-8263-51fabd7433d9",
                                "text": "For years mechanical refrigerator salesmen have delighted in sticking their finger down inside the drainpipe of an ice refrigerator and drawing it out covered with slime, in an effort to demonstrate to the housewife that ice refrigeration is unclean."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41a671e4-f843-4fea-aea1-1950e2a49617",
                                "sense_id": "648a96c2-b272-3fb1-8263-51fabd7433d9",
                                "text": "Attach the rubber tubing to the drainpipe of the ice chamber and place the end in a pail."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a1e4143-f935-4ae9-9650-e99e441a447d",
                                "sense_id": "648a96c2-b272-3fb1-8263-51fabd7433d9",
                                "text": "Start the securely anchored centrifuge and slowly increase to the proper speed (2000 – 2500 rpm). Solvent will be rapidly expelled from the drainpipe."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6cd73f2d-9957-3847-8319-5969d68f10af",
                        "entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The type of pipe that is used to construct a drainpipe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f78ff2ee-765e-43b0-b021-6d338c947b08",
                                "sense_id": "6cd73f2d-9957-3847-8319-5969d68f10af",
                                "text": "Hold a length of drainpipe vertically and stuff a loose wad of metal gauze up into the lower end."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd5e50a4-91e4-4e8d-a73e-69eb78fb0126",
                                "sense_id": "6cd73f2d-9957-3847-8319-5969d68f10af",
                                "text": ". Buy enough unperforated, rigid plastic drainpipe for the job at a building supply center; also buy a 90-degree drainpipe elbow, drainpipe couplings, and any adapter available to join the drainpipe and downspout."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c874d0f6-9c18-4de2-a927-0a43a0b78597",
                                "sense_id": "6cd73f2d-9957-3847-8319-5969d68f10af",
                                "text": "Tangled in the bushes we found a rusty length of drainpipe; we fastened it to the tree and made a kind of big nest above in the branches and spent a lot of time scrambling up and down the tree into the nest and hollering secret coded messages into the drainpipe to a comrade below."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "243b9adf-c3d8-4faa-950d-9dd6f9cfd3dd",
                                "sense_id": "6cd73f2d-9957-3847-8319-5969d68f10af",
                                "text": "It stood upended in the middle of the room, cylindrical as a length of earthenware drainpipe – which, in fact, it was – and gay as a Joseph's coat of many colours."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13aeb078-ba1d-3a01-ac5a-1ab2bbe61395",
                        "entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of form-fitting trousers with highly tapered legs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b52091b6-f9b3-40d8-b397-8b0f973be352",
                                "sense_id": "13aeb078-ba1d-3a01-ac5a-1ab2bbe61395",
                                "text": "At the flick of a switch I would change mode and tart up in my new Toby, a horrendous copy of a Savile Row suit, waisted, with a twelve-inch vent at the back, drainpipe trousers and a rose in my buttonhole."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0366674-b943-486b-b291-a53f7c8211fa",
                                "sense_id": "13aeb078-ba1d-3a01-ac5a-1ab2bbe61395",
                                "text": "He was skinny, and wearing drainpipe jeans and a gothic Tshirt with the word 'VOMIT' in silver sparkly letters on black."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8451fb85-8f52-48d4-a0fe-e97403f62671",
                                "sense_id": "13aeb078-ba1d-3a01-ac5a-1ab2bbe61395",
                                "text": "You also had punks who were again easily identifiable as a group and the members of that group did their best to look different, sporting different uses of hair colour and rips that could occur anywhere in their black drainpipe jeans, army trousers, or in their prolific graffiti'd denim jackets, as well as the hard wearing black leather studded jackets which would sometimes have the famous anarchy symbol and the names of whatever punk bands the individual happened to admire."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6449a432-77e1-429b-85a7-0bb4f7054f29",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "source_sense_description": "pipe connecting the drain to the gutter",
                        "target_lang_word": "descente",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "descente",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "423e018b-5862-3fd9-832e-c3caca1ca60b",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de descendre, d’aller vers le bas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "930ef610-a45c-4626-a0ac-b398e43e01be",
                                                "sense_id": "423e018b-5862-3fd9-832e-c3caca1ca60b",
                                                "text": "Nous reprenons le raidillon ; il n'est guère plus drôle à descendre qu'à monter : tantôt nous étions courbés en avant, maintenant il faut, pour la descente, se rejeter en arrière..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bf36067-8ec5-39a7-b50e-33aee2732144",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action par laquelle on descend quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2b8c490-4ba0-4555-b0c5-d819612bc275",
                                                "sense_id": "9bf36067-8ec5-39a7-b50e-33aee2732144",
                                                "text": "La descente de la châsse de sainte Geneviève."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87acb543-4cb0-3739-8f8e-30a46da5f7f3",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pente par laquelle on descend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "metonymically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07c6e5b8-b262-4f7d-9314-ee8fe40dd437",
                                                "sense_id": "87acb543-4cb0-3739-8f8e-30a46da5f7f3",
                                                "text": "Le creusement d’un escalier en descente était une opération difficile et pénible, le mineur devant creuser plus bas que ses pieds au marteau et à la cisette, sous le faible éclairage des lampes à huile et avec une aération défectueuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "767163ee-8736-49bf-8c38-72ae9915a0e3",
                                                "sense_id": "87acb543-4cb0-3739-8f8e-30a46da5f7f3",
                                                "text": "Nous allons trouver une descente à quelque distance. - Cette montagne est très escarpée, cet escalier est trop raide, la descente en est pénible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34209c1a-98b8-3ac9-8ec7-d287d6b3691e",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tuyau qui porte les eaux d’un chéneau ou d’une cuvette jusque sur le pavé ou par lequel descendent les eaux d’un réservoir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "metonymically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe6b5594-5361-4c23-b3c7-45c598512255",
                                                "sense_id": "34209c1a-98b8-3ac9-8ec7-d287d6b3691e",
                                                "text": "Une descente de fer, de plomb. - Tuyau de descente."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db8cd19c-4d2f-3312-8695-ebaed704a98b",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Discipline de course à ski."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ski alpin"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef71dfe1-daec-3f69-9cc6-760a5ecbf15d",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Discipline de course en canoë-kayak."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canoë-kayak"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64cc5e35-0966-3525-ac29-91987be0a5ff",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Discipline de VTT."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0664c25-5349-34d5-81b8-403301cdf13f",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mouvement de haut en bas de quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb88822a-5860-4800-8133-6b0a13c5df60",
                                                "sense_id": "c0664c25-5349-34d5-81b8-403301cdf13f",
                                                "text": "La descente des eaux. - Hâter la descente d’un aérostat, en laissant échapper une partie du gaz qu’il contient."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6c52f81-46cd-3825-8162-fae4e23cae89",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hernie, ou autre incommodité, qui consiste dans le déplacement et la chute de quelque partie des intestins."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Absolument"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d31c6ecc-51a6-4e9a-a15b-01f49970452a",
                                                "sense_id": "f6c52f81-46cd-3825-8162-fae4e23cae89",
                                                "text": "Il a une descente qui l’empêche d’aller à cheval."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53732120-0c49-38ce-8161-2ed1ed1f2f4a",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de se déplacer temporairement d’un endroit à un autre, pour un séjour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "analogy"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "263bb257-ab9a-3ce5-ac11-521b01ca8bbc",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Irruption des ennemis par mer ou par terre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef1b8c8d-9bdb-4272-a970-955564fff3f0",
                                                "sense_id": "263bb257-ab9a-3ce5-ac11-521b01ca8bbc",
                                                "text": "Enfin la prospérité croissante des finances permit de fournir, aux besoins de l’état et à ceux de l’armée, et de concentrer des forces imposantes dans la province de Vera-Cruz, qu’on croyait menacée d’une descente prochaine de 12,000 Espagnols réunis à la Havane, sous les ordres du général Moralès."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f065261a-2914-3c6b-8ce6-e8796652f9f1",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de se transporter dans un lieu par autorité de justice, ou par action policière, pour en faire la visite, pour y procéder à une perquisition, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9aebf99f-0f81-4ddc-b8d3-8014f52251e7",
                                                "sense_id": "f065261a-2914-3c6b-8ce6-e8796652f9f1",
                                                "text": "Et la rue retomba dans le demi-silence, la torpeur, la résignation qu'une descente de police laisse toujours derrière elle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "998ddd4d-a006-4d37-ac7d-c97847d6fc15",
                                                "sense_id": "f065261a-2914-3c6b-8ce6-e8796652f9f1",
                                                "text": "— Tout est fini dès maintenant, n’est-ce pas ?… Ne croyez-vous pas que votre place est là-haut, où il faudra bien faire une descente du Parquet ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa010fc2-2bb3-4d4a-bae1-a7592719b7ac",
                                                "sense_id": "f065261a-2914-3c6b-8ce6-e8796652f9f1",
                                                "text": "– On a pris Pierrot, chuchotait Marie Gérard, le petit métallo, le communiste. La Gestapo a fait une descente chez le bistrot où il logeait…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f2108a4-246f-4245-9d6e-73fac34eaefe",
                                                "sense_id": "f065261a-2914-3c6b-8ce6-e8796652f9f1",
                                                "text": "Des descentes de police visent les « cayennes ». Pour éviter leur saisie, les compagnons détruisent eux-mêmes leurs documents régulièrement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e75664f-fb36-3be3-a0d9-1d33b4b770c8",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Soif, appétit démesuré."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9eb60c7c-9c85-4b4f-9e12-6decae472d93",
                                                "sense_id": "6e75664f-fb36-3be3-a0d9-1d33b4b770c8",
                                                "text": "C’est Raoul mon pitbull\nQui l’a trouvée appétissante\nC’est Raoul mon pitbull\nIl est gentil mais quelle descente !\nIl aime jouer, il est cool\nMais s’il a un p’tit creux dans l’ventre\nIl te croque dès que tu rentres\nC’est Raoul mon pitbull"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f43f847-0324-3a7c-9d92-a0ce9862e5f4",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fin de trip, retour à un état hors d’effet d’une drogue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Toxicomanie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4855fc4-accf-4eca-8cc8-ca4a49ac391c",
                                                "sense_id": "5f43f847-0324-3a7c-9d92-a0ce9862e5f4",
                                                "text": "En vrai, j’ai passé trois jours sous ecstasy dans une fête anarcho-syndicaliste organisée dans une maison du quartier de St Paul's. Ce sont les hallucinations, puis la descente, qui m’ont fait réaliser combien cette existence stérile, sans rime ni raison, me foutait en l’air."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aea88a52-0619-3f1a-a91c-b8c776cedbc4",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sorte de surprise-partie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bcbf95d-904d-4a84-8b49-607b01dd6bb7",
                                                "sense_id": "aea88a52-0619-3f1a-a91c-b8c776cedbc4",
                                                "text": "Dès que j’avais tourné les talons, Geneviève et Hubert invitaient des amis, organisaient des « descentes », malgré mon interdiction formelle ; et tu étais complice de leur désobéissance « parce que, disais-tu, il faut bien rendre ses politesses…»"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6121991d-41e7-3e69-b22b-585fffa68864",
                                        "entry_id": "ebeb7d13-ab3e-340b-a0ca-d543c3d691d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ouverture dans le pont d’un navire munie d’une échelle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5f2da32f-00b0-4840-8aa1-5b28a30eca33",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "source_sense_description": "pipe connecting the drain to the gutter",
                        "target_lang_word": "Regenrohr",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c034e068-a96b-41db-9b7b-82d0e86260a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffdc10da-7cac-374c-b4f8-3008f47a5e76",
                        "source_sense_description": "pipe connecting the drain to the gutter",
                        "target_lang_word": "Fallrohr",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Fallrohr",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e70037b1-5863-34c6-a829-9ee74a81fda1",
                                        "entry_id": "76627805-57c4-3ff4-bcb9-15d5df15acc5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "senkrecht abfallendes Rohr, durch das Wasser von einer höheren Fläche zu einer niedrigeren Fläche abgeführt wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7f44476-124a-4e53-b3b1-185b347bdee3",
                                                "sense_id": "e70037b1-5863-34c6-a829-9ee74a81fda1",
                                                "text": "Der Durchmesser des passenden Fallrohrs richtet sich nach der Dachgröße und dem Durchmesser der jeweiligen gewählten Dachrinne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baa26cf0-4eda-4b9d-857f-cd9435bad636",
                                                "sense_id": "e70037b1-5863-34c6-a829-9ee74a81fda1",
                                                "text": "An eine Rinne aus Titanzink können theoretisch Fallrohre aus Kupfer angeschlossen werden, nicht jedoch umgekehrt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be5a1f4c-fbbf-4440-a0a2-7ad280edb3b5",
                                                "sense_id": "e70037b1-5863-34c6-a829-9ee74a81fda1",
                                                "text": "Dies liegt darin begründet, dass die im abfließenden Regenwasser enthaltenen Kupferionen bei den Fallrohren aus Zink Korrosion hervorrufen und zur Entstehung von Löchern beitragen kann."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e810cf02-911a-4cc6-85b3-667e6b12a1d0",
                                                "sense_id": "e70037b1-5863-34c6-a829-9ee74a81fda1",
                                                "text": "Bei Regen werden die Blätter in die Regenrinne gespült und landen schliesslich im Fallrohr."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0820cb89-9a38-4536-b173-870c4c58eea2",
                                                "sense_id": "e70037b1-5863-34c6-a829-9ee74a81fda1",
                                                "text": "Falls das Fallrohr eines Dachrinne verstopft ist, brauchen Sie eine Rohrreinigungsspirale aus dem Baumarkt und eine lange Leiter."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
